Keep filenames out of shell source when opening external editors.

TMPDIR and profile paths may contain shell metacharacters or non-UTF-8 bytes.
The user's editor setting remains a shell command; the filename is a separate
positional argument shared by CLI, TUI descriptions and configuration editing.
Includes regression tests for literal paths and editor options.
Upstream status: local patch.
Reference: https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/utilities/sh.html

